    {
      "title": "Realism Mode",
      "description": "Realism Mode is a complete gameplay overhaul for Zombies, designed to make Zombies feel more grounded, dangerous, and survival-focused.\n\nThe goal is to strip away many of the arcade-style systems and replace them with mechanics that feel closer to a military survival experience.\n\nPlayers have to rely more on positioning, scavenging, weapon choice, movement, teamwork, and the environment.\n\nMajor Features:\n\nHeavily reduced HUD\n\ncustom Pack-a-Punch progression\n\ncustom perks from the campaign\n\nReworked Mystery Box\n\nReworked weapon rarity and attachments\n\nRandomized physical floor weapons\n\nWall-buy replacements\n\nPhysical ammunition and armor supplies\n\nScrap drops for crafting\n\nReworked Outbreak rewards\n\nPermanent character upgrades earned through gameplay\n\nReworked armor\n\nMore realistic weapon handling and recoil (PC Only)\n\nWeapon-specific stamina behavior\n\nReduced bunny hopping and movement exploits\n\nInjury and low-health mechanics\n\nAdrenaline response at critical health\n\nFriendly fire / team damage\n\nRebalanced normal, armored, special, and elite enemies\n\nArmored zombies are slower but significantly tougher\n\nRebalanced boss health for co-op\n\nReworked melee weapons and gun-butt attacks\n\nRebalanced explosives and launchers\n\nVehicle durability\n\nOutbreak progression and loadout persistence\n\nReworked side-objective rewards\n\nTrials reintroduced with Realism-specific rewards",
      "author": {
        "discordName": "saintvertigo",
        "id": "684408486456852481",
        "name": "SaintVertigo"
      },
      "publishedBy": null,
      "developer": true,
